370	
371	5. **Setup Recommendations**
372	   - Suggest form settings (collect email, limit to 1 response, etc.)
373	   - Recommend data validation rules
374	   - Propose notification settings for new responses
375	   - Suggest basic formulas or formatting for the response sheet
376	
377	6. **Provide Summary**
